    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d290">

                <pb facs="0464" n="370" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg370"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Olney to Mr. Mendoza.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-12-29"><hi rendition="#italic">December 29,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the
                    receipt of your excellency’s note of September 22, 1896, wherewith you inclose,
                    with an office copy, the letter of the Diet of the Greater Republic of Central
                    America, addressed to the President advising him of the new political
                    organization of the Republics of Honduras, Nicaragua, and Salvador, agreeably to
                    the provisions of the treaty concluded between them at Amapala, Honduras, June
                    20, 1895, the said treaty having been formally ratified and exchanged.</p>
                <p>I inclose the President’s reply, dated the 29th instant, with the customary
                    office copy, and request that, through your courtesy, it may properly reach its
                    high destination.</p>
                <p>I avail, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Richard Olney.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d290-a1.xml" xpointer="d290-a1"/>
            </div>
